# .dockerignore for the commit-image build (-f mayhem/Dockerfile). BuildKit gives THIS file full
# precedence over any context-root .dockerignore for that build — p11-kit ships none of its own, but
# we still pin this explicitly so a future upstream root .dockerignore can never silently strip
# fixtures or .git out of the build context (docs/netnew-worker-prompt.md §4b).
#
# Goal: bake in the FULL repo (including .git history — the grader/PATCH tier need it), dropping only
# OUR OWN local scratch build dirs. NOTE: p11-kit ships a real, tracked top-level `build/` directory
# (autotools m4 macros, cross files, cert fixtures) — do NOT exclude `build/` or `out/` generically,
# that would delete real upstream content. Our own scratch dirs are named distinctly to avoid the
# collision.

# ── Our own scratch build dirs (mayhem/build.sh output; never committed) ───────────────────────────
mayhem-build/
mayhem-tests/

# ── Editor / OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
